# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
#
# Eventbrite has NO app-level API credentials — each user's personal Eventbrite
# token arrives through the connector's OAuth login form (served at /authorize),
# not from here. Nothing is required in this file to run the hosted connector
# locally; it exists only as the conventional place for any future Worker-only
# dev override.
